# Slam - hold both, then throw the new one in on the beat.
#
# For genres where a fade is simply wrong. The only preparation is a lift on the arriving
# track's top end so it cuts through the moment it appears.

name    Slam
note    no fade at all - the new one simply arrives, on the beat
align   beat
tempo   free
power   free

lane out gain
    at 0.0    1.0    hold
    at 0.5    0.0    hold
    at 1.0    0.0    hold

lane in gain
    at 0.0    0.0    hold
    at 0.5    1.0    hold
    at 1.0    1.0    hold

lane in high
    at 0.0      6    hold
    at 0.5      6    smooth
    at 1.0      0    hold
